--- !u!114 &11400112
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Welcome_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_welcome_3
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "외곽의 시련 세 곳을 먼저 통과해. 중앙 평가는 그다음이야. 그리고 안에서 세운 작전은 큰 소리로 복습하지 않는 게 좋아!"
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_end
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 1180, y: 520}
--- !u!114 &11400120
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 33dbbdb6f707d9846a5e61bf67613e4e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Node_Secret_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeId: guide_secret_1
  nodeType: 0
  channel: 0
  speakerId: "안내인"
  dialogueText: "쉿. 밖에서는 지난 원정 이야기를 하면 안 돼. 시련장이 다음 배치에 바로 써먹거든."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  typingSpeed: 0.04
  autoAdvanceDuration: 0
  nextNodeId: guide_secret_2
  trueNextNodeId: 
  falseNextNodeId: 
  choices: []
  condition: {fileID: 0}
  eventActions: []
  cameraRecording: {fileID: 0}
  editorPosition: {x: 620, y: 260}
